{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/d6932cacc177b949d8b3d8e47e941b54.avif?t=1770399514\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MineGeon: Renegades</strong> is a sci-fi roguelite bullet-hell focused on resource gathering. After a failed heist, a group known as the <i>Renegades</i> is forced to flee, crash landing near the mysterious planet <strong>Paimo</strong>. With no other choice, they descend into its depths in search of help\u00a0and uncover secrets that should have remained buried.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/b7beff38ac4f2d4892c1499b1084ebe9.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/b7beff38ac4f2d4892c1499b1084ebe9.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/b7beff38ac4f2d4892c1499b1084ebe9.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend <strong>alone</strong> or with up to <strong>two friends</strong> to explore the depths of PAIMO together. Coordinate your moves and share gadgets teamwork is essential to survive. But watch your back... sometimes you\u2019ll need to unleash your inner renegade and break away from the group to maximize your rewards.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GADGETS, WEAPONS AND ULTIMATES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/51fecb79f555f25365cb35a1d316395e.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/51fecb79f555f25365cb35a1d316395e.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/51fecb79f555f25365cb35a1d316395e.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the MineGeon, you can level up to unlock powerful <strong>Gadgets</strong>, tools that grant a wide variety of upgrades to aid you in battle. You can also choose from different <strong>Ultimates</strong>, special abilities that define your playstyle, and equip a range of <strong>weapons</strong> to suit your approach. Combining Gadgets, Weapons, and Ultimates creates unique synergies that will shape your descent into Paimo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER YOUR MINERALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/670b10c8509265577867b8dc8916c845.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/670b10c8509265577867b8dc8916c845.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/670b10c8509265577867b8dc8916c845.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAIMO is filled with minerals that bring out your inner greed.\u00a0The deeper you descend, the greater the rewards and the risks. Collect valuable minerals and trade them for permanent upgrades, but choose wisely when to send them back to your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE CHALLENGING ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/114462fc8eb1fe75fdfc04f893be2217.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/114462fc8eb1fe75fdfc04f893be2217.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/114462fc8eb1fe75fdfc04f893be2217.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The biomes of PAIMO are home to a vast array of enemies.\u00a0Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll encounter the <strong>Scavengers</strong>, who will do anything to stop your descent. Why are they so determined to keep you from going deeper? Each biome culminates in a <strong>boss battle</strong> that will push your skills and strategies to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE AND PROGRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/1acdebce981a0bb9d8275b00a29e9332.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/1acdebce981a0bb9d8275b00a29e9332.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/1acdebce981a0bb9d8275b00a29e9332.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>n MineGeon: Renegades, progression is key to your survival and success.<strong>\u00a0</strong>As you explore and gather resources, you can upgrade your skills and equipment to grow stronger with every run. Invest in <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> for your spaceship and enhance each <strong>Renegade\u2019s  attributes</strong> to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR RENEGADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/77bcc84105ae2ce69aa75e4a9e935347.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/77bcc84105ae2ce69aa75e4a9e935347.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/77bcc84105ae2ce69aa75e4a9e935347.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three classes, each with their own ultimate ability and unique stats. From <strong>Marshall</strong>, the resilient <strong>Tank</strong>, to <strong>Trevor</strong>, the deadly <strong>DPS</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gunslinger</strong>, and <strong>Ari</strong>, the balanced <strong>Engineer</strong>. Find your role within the team and combine your strengths with other Renegades to maximize your chances of surviving the descent into <strong>PAIMO</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/d706d1989d34465aec2b4f356bcbb274.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/d706d1989d34465aec2b4f356bcbb274.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/d706d1989d34465aec2b4f356bcbb274.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within Paimo lie mysterious monoliths pulsing with ancient technology. These relics let the Renegades decide how to continue their descent, vote as a team to choose the path that benefits everyone, or follow your own ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into the depths with your friends!\u00a0Forge your path, gather power, and survive. Do you have what it takes to reach the deepest part of <strong>Pa\u27ca\u29eb\u235c\u2026</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add MineGeon: Renegades to your wishlist and join the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227240?t=1770399514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/ff51cb2e342ef7ac9f056df1a5c173d23acaf00d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770399514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/d3e03c4264ee9c6568fdc8182fdca47f71e0151d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770399514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/d3e03c4264ee9c6568fdc8182fdca47f71e0151d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770399514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4224830,"description":""}],"detailed_description