" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE CHALLENGING ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/114462fc8eb1fe75fdfc04f893be2217.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/114462fc8eb1fe75fdfc04f893be2217.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/114462fc8eb1fe75fdfc04f893be2217.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The biomes of PAIMO are home to a vast array of enemies.\u00a0Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll encounter the <strong>Scavengers</strong>, who will do anything to stop your descent. Why are they so determined to keep you from going deeper? Each biome culminates in a <strong>boss battle</strong> that will push your skills and strategies to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE AND PROGRESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/1acdebce981a0bb9d8275b00a29e9332.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/1acdebce981a0bb9d8275b00a29e9332.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/1acdebce981a0bb9d8275b00a29e9332.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I</strong>n MineGeon: Renegades, progression is key to your survival and success.<strong>\u00a0</strong>As you explore and gather resources, you can upgrade your skills and equipment to grow stronger with every run. Invest in <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> for your spaceship and enhance each <strong>Renegade\u2019s  attributes</strong> to prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR RENEGADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/77bcc84105ae2ce69aa75e4a9e935347.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/77bcc84105ae2ce69aa75e4a9e935347.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/77bcc84105ae2ce69aa75e4a9e935347.mp4?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three classes, each with their own ultimate ability and unique stats. From <strong>Marshall</strong>, the resilient <strong>Tank</strong>, to <strong>Trevor</strong>, the deadly <strong>DPS</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gunslinger</strong>, and <strong>Ari</strong>, the balanced <strong>Engineer</strong>. Find your role within the team and combine your strengths with other Renegades to maximize your chances of surviving the descent into <strong>PAIMO</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/d706d1989d34465aec2b4f356bcbb274.poster.avif?t=1770399514\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227240/extras/d706d1989d34465aec2b4f356bcbb274.webm?t=1770399514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht